OL,3,GNEWSAFunding approved for Egyptian
OL,4,AHalls redevelopment plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FFunding to progress a potential
OL,7,Fredevelopment of a derelict category
OL,8,FA-listed building in the centre of
OL,9,FGlasgow has been approved in a bid to
OL,10,Fbring it back into use.
OL,12,FGlasgow City Council has given the
OL,13,Fgreen light for up to #600,000 in grant
OL,14,Ffunding to support the early stages of
OL,15,Fplans to turn the Egyptian Halls,
OL,16,Fdesigned by legendary Scottish
OL,17,Farchitect Alexander "Greek" Thomson,
OL,18,Finto a hotel.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
