OL,3,GNEWSAFunding approved for Egyptian
OL,4,AHalls redevelopment plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe four-storey building on Union
OL,7,FStreet, near Central Station, was built
OL,8,Fin the 1870s and has been on the
OL,9,Fbuildings-at-risk register since 1990.
OL,11,FThe funding package will be used to
OL,12,Fdevelop the council-backed plans before
OL,13,Fa possible compulsory purchase of the
OL,14,Fbuilding.
